{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128160611433-1128_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261128160611\"/><p>被捕人士涉嫌向彌敦道一培訓中心出示偽造香港身份證。</p><p>今晨(28日)9時28分，旺角彌敦道701號一間培訓中心的職員報案，指一名男子懷疑出示偽造的香港身份證出席培訓課程。警員接報到場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「行使虛假文書」及「逾期逗留」拘捕一名持雙程證的姓劉(64歲)內地男子，他現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:15:39.567824+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T08:06:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:12:27.730939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:09:15.309627+00:00","content_hash":"ed5c2d380d92579a8c3ae671f3ceae3228b0f16431d69140c7dc4c7ffd9b6e2c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:15:39.567824+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}